# INVWINSL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: several rows
# selected in the item list, with the sixty items of TEST/KEYS/RLLONG.REQ,
# by SHIFT and arrows and by clicks with SHIFT, CTRL or both, the count
# panel saying how many.  A single-row command acts on the focus row and
# keeps the others; a plain press on a selected row keeps them until its
# release, a double click opens the row clicked; with none selected Move
# acts on the focus row.  SHIFT-DOWN past the window's last row and
# SHIFT-UP past its first, with two rows chosen, beep and keep them, in
# add mode too, where a plain DOWN still pages.  PGDN, HOME, Next order
# and a heading's click drop the selection.  The pick lists and the location
# tree select one row, the contents beside the tree several.  Back on the
# item list a CTRL click and a right press on the focus row leave the next
# DOWN plain, SHIFT-F10 keeps the rows, and SHIFT at the list's ends keeps
# them, as a cancelled new loan of two does, and a press held on them
# keeps them when released on another row, and is forgotten by a refill
# before its release; F5 drops them, as its reload refills the list.  DEL
# on three rows counts the list three less, as its count is kept apart
# from the rows shown.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSL.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K SHIFT-DOWN
S PAIR
K ALT-C U
S SPLITASK
K ESC
S SPLITBK
K SHIFT-DOWN
S SHDOWN
K DOWN
S DOWN
# from the anchor, item 4, to item 7
M 208.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 6
M 208.1 UP ROW 6
S SHCLICK
# item 10 added, the anchor there
M 208.1 CTRL-DOWN ROW 9
M 208.1 UP ROW 9
S CTRLIN
# items 10 to 12 added
M 208.1 CTRL-SHIFT-DOWN ROW 11
M 208.1 UP ROW 11
S ADDRANGE
# item 6 taken away, the anchor there
M 208.1 CTRL-DOWN ROW 5
M 208.1 UP ROW 5
S CTRLOUT
M 208.1 SHIFT-DOWN ROW 7
M 208.1 UP ROW 7
S ANCHOR
K SHIFT-UP
S SHUP
K CTRL-DOWN
S CTRLDN
# a press on item 9 among three selected keeps them; its release not
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 8
S HELDDN
M 208.1 UP ROW 8
S HELDUP
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S THREE
K ENTER
S OPEN
K ESC
S OPENBK
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
K ESC
S EDITBK
# a double click on item 10 among three selected
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 9
M 208.1 UP ROW 9
M 208.1 DBL ROW 9
S DBLOPEN
K ESC
M 208.1 UP ROW 9
S DBLBK
# the last selected row taken away: Move on the focus row
M 208.1 CTRL-DOWN ROW 9
M 208.1 UP ROW 9
S NONESEL
K ALT-C M
S NONEMOVE
K F4 HOME SHIFT-DOWN
S PICKSH
K ESC ESC
# SHIFT-DOWN past the window's last row
K HOME
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 18
M 208.1 UP ROW 18
K SHIFT-DOWN
S PAGEBOT
K SHIFT-DOWN
S OFFPAGE
K SHIFT-F8 SHIFT-DOWN
S ADDEDGE
K SHIFT-F8 DOWN
S PLAINDN
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 5
M 208.1 UP ROW 5
K SHIFT-DOWN
S PGSEL
K PGDN
S PGDN
# SHIFT-UP above the window's first row, two rows chosen
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
K SHIFT-UP
S PGTOP
K SHIFT-UP
S UPEDGE
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 5
M 208.1 UP ROW 5
K SHIFT-DOWN
S HOMESEL
K HOME
S HOME
K SHIFT-DOWN
S ORDSEL
K ALT-C R
S ORDER
K HOME SHIFT-DOWN
S HEADSEL
M 208 DOWN HEAD 2
M 208 UP HEAD 2
S HEAD
K ALT-L B SHIFT-DOWN
S TREESH
K TAB SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S CONTSH
# back to the item list: CTRL on the focus row, then DOWN alone
K ESC ESC HOME SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
M 208.1 CTRL-DOWN ROW 2
M 208.1 UP ROW 2
S FLIPF
K DOWN
S FLIPDN
# a right press on the focus row keeps the rows; then DOWN alone
K HOME SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
M 208.1 RDOWN ROW 2
M 208.1 RUP ROW 2
K ESC
S KEEPF
K DOWN
S KEEPDN
# SHIFT-F10 at a focus row below the first keeps the rows
K SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-F10
S F10KEEP
K ESC
# SHIFT at the list's first and last rows keeps the rows
K HOME DOWN SHIFT-UP SHIFT-UP
S TOPSH
K END UP SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
S ENDSH
# a new loan of the two cancelled: the help panel empty, the rows kept
K CTRL-L ESC
S LENDESC
# a press held on a selection released on another row keeps them
K HOME SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 1
M 208.1 UP ROW 3
S RELOTHER
# a press held on a selection, HOME refilling the list, then its release
M 208.1 DOWN ROW 1
K HOME
M 208.1 UP ROW 1
S FILLUP
# F5 fetches the list again, which drops the rows chosen
K HOME SHIFT-DOWN
S F5SEL
K F5
S F5
K HOME SHIFT-DOWN SHIFT-DOWN DEL Y
S DELMANY
K ALT-F X
